<!doctype html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5;">
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
  <p>Someone asked to reset the password for your Collaboration Tool account. Use this link within the next hour to choose a new password:</p>
  <p><a href="{{reset_url}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ffb454; color: #000; text-decoration: none;">Reset your password</a></p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">Or paste this address into your browser: {{reset_url}}</p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password will not change.</p>
</body>
</html>
